Third-party datasets
--------------------
This project uses two public datasets, each licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The raw data is not redistributed:
it is not included in this repository or in any release, and is downloaded
locally from the original sources (see data/manifest.yaml and `pumpcopilot
